{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C3\", \"C1\", \"C2\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C3\", \"C1\", \"C2\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C1在内容完整、因果连贯和语言自然之间最均衡，C3多保留了内心选择的限定但略显重复，C2虽然简洁却牺牲了不少实质内容。keep：C3用“只是在心里”明确保留了继续喜欢是内心决定而非对外表态，C1基本保全了清单内容但这一界限不够明确，C2则遗漏了尊重对方自主心意、不把期待变成压力以及充分享受欢喜等内容。cover：C3把继续喜欢明确限定为内心的决定，最能解释尾声为何既有落定的力量又保留温热与牵挂，C1也能通过过去的快乐、未来可能的疼痛和不收回心意解释这种状态，C2提供的心理依据较少。lean：C1的因果链条最完整且没有明显赘句，C2虽然简短但前三项之间的衔接较松，C3末句把继续喜欢和不收回心意表达得略有重复。plain：C1的表达最自然，具体呈现了他如何对待对方、过去的经历和未来的失望，C3的“只是在心里……把它收回”稍显绕口，C2的“希望对方是自己愿意靠近”则存在明显的语义歧义。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "55471569-1afd-4b35-bef7-00da1672fb5d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T230527503366Z", "elapsed_seconds": 85.813, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:06:53.303454+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6f3a6741457d672fa541ef744366ceba5cbda2111e17b053661968b2dddf5d6a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "59688